# Frontend FSD

Import direction: `routes` → `components` → `features` → `entities` → `shared`.

Monorepo layout: `apps/mini-app`, `apps/admin`, `apps/landing`; shared UI in `packages/ui`, API types in `packages/api-client`, cross-app helpers in `packages/types`.

## mini-app (TMA SPA)

- Layout: `routes/_tma.tsx` → `components/tma-shell/tma-layout.tsx`
- Tab routes: `/`, `/meetings`, `/checker`, `/profile`
- Overlay routes: `/meetings/create`, `/profile/colleague`
- Detail: `/meetings/$meetingId`
- Auth: `shared/auth/auth-context.tsx` + `components/tma-shell/auth-gate.tsx`
- `ssr: false` — static nginx build for Telegram WebView

### Feature slices (mini-app)

```
features/
  home/pages/
  meetings/{components/,pages/}
  meeting-create/{components/,lib/,pages/}
  checker/{components/,pages/}
  profile/{components/,pages/}
entities/
  employee/   — types, api, queries
  meeting/    — types, api, queries, mutations
  settings/   — api, queries
shared/
  api/        — client, types, query-client, query-keys
  auth/       — session, tma-api, auth-context
  lib/        — format, …
  tma/        — telegram-env
components/   — tma-shell/*, meetings/*, states, employee-picker
```

## admin (web dashboard)

- Layout: `routes/_app.tsx` → `components/app-sidebar.tsx`
- Routes: dashboard, meetings, members, invites; auth via `_auth`, onboarding
- Cookie session + CSRF (`shared/api/client.ts`)

### Feature slices (admin)

```
features/
  dashboard/pages/
  meetings/{components/,lib/,pages/}
  members/{components/,pages/}
  invites/{components/,pages/}
  auth/components/
entities/
  meeting/    — types, api, queries, mutations
  org/        — types, api, queries
shared/
  api/        — client, active-org, query-client
  auth/       — api, use-me, use-active-org
  lib/        — toast, cn
components/   — app-sidebar, list-page-shell, page-loading, route-error-page
```

Feature X must not import feature Y; share via `shared/`, `entities/`, `components/`, or `packages/*`.

ESLint `featureModules` in `apps/*/config/eslint.config.ts` enforces cross-feature boundaries.

## File size

Hand-written `.ts`/`.tsx` files **≤300 lines**. Split pages into `components/` subfolders; extract UI repeated 2+ times.

## Data loading

- `@leadcat/api-client`: `createApiClient`, `apiFetch`, `ApiError`, OpenAPI types (`pnpm openapi:generate`)
- mini-app: Bearer JWT via `shared/api/client.ts`; 401 reauth in `auth-context`
- admin: cookie session; CSRF + `X-Org-Id` interceptors
- `queryOptions` / read hooks in `entities/*/queries.ts`; mutations in `entities/*/mutations.ts`
- Client-side fetching via TanStack Query `useQuery` / `useMutation`

## Tooling

- `pnpm openapi:generate` → `packages/api-client/src/generated/schema.ts`
- React Router 7 file-based routes (`app/routes/*`)
- `pnpm lint` — ESLint + `import/no-restricted-paths` (FSD layers + feature boundaries)
- pnpm only; UI from `@leadcat/ui`
